a psychedelic therapist is the more

dda73e4b-e69e-4489-bc83-43cfb31d1216-1
00:05:26.837 --> 00:05:30.656
holistic model,
whereas a bullet facilitator is generally

dda73e4b-e69e-4489-bc83-43cfb31d1216-2
00:05:30.656 --> 00:05:34.080
the person that is with them during
administration.

e3b3a548-0391-4b79-9b80-17efec88ea36-0
00:05:34.440 --> 00:05:40.262
Generally doesn't have to be separately
credentialed outside of the Department of

e3b3a548-0391-4b79-9b80-17efec88ea36-1
00:05:40.262 --> 00:05:40.760
Health.

e6b34f96-3ac2-482d-857a-81c9cf442132-0
00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:45.891
Whereas the psychedelic therapist is
generally already a licensed healthcare

e6b34f96-3ac2-482d-857a-81c9cf442132-1
00:05:45.891 --> 00:05:46.440
provider.

d1f70be6-1993-4125-800d-0da5fd5e7bc2-0
00:05:48.440 --> 00:05:50.760
So let's get into the psychological
preparation.

7d783008-22c7-4372-ae67-515fae79f965-0
00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:53.356
So the psychedel,
the psychedelic therapist must be

7d783008-22c7-4372-ae67-515fae79f965-1
00:05:53.356 --> 00:05:57.151
involved in the psychological preparation
process to establish the clinical

7d783008-22c7-4372-ae67-515fae79f965-2
00:05:57.151 --> 00:05:58.400
foundation for treatment.

ad989a71-1485-4608-9b89-e2e487a091d7-0
00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:00.960
So they established the timing.

21f07771-577a-4bb7-bb33-9ac2c415036a-0
00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:04.387
This phase must occur first to allow the
therapist to determine medical

21f07771-577a-4bb7-bb33-9ac2c415036a-1
00:06:04.387 --> 00:06:07.720
appropriateness and approve or to firm
participation based on safety.

350d8bff-c671-4b87-bab6-0c1bef3f5936-0
00:06:08.640 --> 00:06:09.520
Clinical assessment.

80e844b4-d9d6-46ea-8427-96e459e29391-0
00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:13.849
The therapist conducts A comprehensive
biopsychosocial assessment and reviews

80e844b4-d9d6-46ea-8427-96e459e29391-1
00:06:13.849 --> 00:06:16.457
medical,
including medication interactions and

80e844b4-d9d6-46ea-8427-96e459e29391-2
00:06:16.457 --> 00:06:19.898
contraindications,
mental health and substance abuse history,

80e844b4-d9d6-46ea-8427-96e459e29391-3
00:06:19.898 --> 00:06:21.119
intention and setting.

45dd2d31-11ff-4f88-b16c-1277742f8343-0
00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:23.880
Intention, setting, and object objectives.

b242b48d-210a-417e-941b-a5b05e167f4b-0
00:06:24.840 --> 00:06:28.508
The The therapist facilitates the
discussion of patient goals, intentions,

b242b48d-210a-417e-941b-a5b05e167f4b-1
00:06:28.508 --> 00:06:32.226
and expectations for the session to
establish a psychological framework for

b242b48d-210a-417e-941b-a5b05e167f4b-2
00:06:32.226 --> 00:06:32.960
the experience.

b713d350-75bb-439c-a313-7356c19c5b57-0
00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:34.680
Orientation to set.

f0ceddc3-69ab-4144-913e-908c06cbffca-0
00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:38.082
The therapist addresses the patient's
physical, emotional,

f0ceddc3-69ab-4144-913e-908c06cbffca-1
00:06:38.082 --> 00:06:41.491
and psychological readiness,
helping them navigate set factors and

f0ceddc3-69ab-4144-913e-908c06cbffca-2
00:06:41.491 --> 00:06:43.120
potential psychological changes.

ab26d9f8-0da4-4dcc-8cf0-e90f9b96ded2-0
00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:45.200
Clinical safety planning.

f5227eb6-9b4a-4e68-a0cd-8f57239821e4-0
00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:49.391
This is where they would evaluate risk
for adverse responses,

f5227eb6-9b4a-4e68-a0cd-8f57239821e4-1
00:06:49.391 --> 00:06:53.652
create a formal safety plan and perform
an assessment of the patient support

f5227eb6-9b4a-4e68-a0cd-8f57239821e4-2
00:06:53.652 --> 00:06:54.040
system.

e5090973-a89b-4b70-a216-d7d85302e85c-0
00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:57.448
In terms of cultural and spiritual
alignment,

e5090973-a89b-4b70-a216-d7d85302e85c-1
00:06:57.448 --> 00:07:01.120
we would use trauma informed and
culturally competent communication.

058ade9e-3a58-4ed5-9ab5-f43b220f1bf6-0
00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:03.840
The therapist ensures alignment regarding
any ceremonial,

058ade9e-3a58-4ed5-9ab5-f43b220f1bf6-1
00:07:03.840 --> 00:07:06.280
cultural or spiritual elements that may
be present.

be28816f-54d4-4575-b740-c89f3c5f5c1c-0
00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:08.560
Dosing and tearing.

81f46b76-bd67-498b-9eb9-b0e89ba9888c-0
00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:11.206
During this phase,
the therapist assigns the clinical

81f46b76-bd67-498b-9eb9-b0e89ba9888c-1
00:07:11.206 --> 00:07:14.440
support tier and establishes dosing
parameters or considerations.

7f9d8ff5-8280-44be-bbe1-36afd2f47098-0
