If a patient is determined to be
clinically inappropriate,

7f9d8ff5-8280-44be-bbe1-36afd2f47098-1
00:07:17.520 --> 00:07:20.774
the therapist is responsible for
referring them to a primary care provider

7f9d8ff5-8280-44be-bbe1-36afd2f47098-2
00:07:20.774 --> 00:07:22.120
